  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">생각만 하던건데 ai도움으로 함수 짜서 완성했습니다.<br>평가계획의 항목 배점 넣으시면<br>- 가능한 배점의 종류가 자동으로 나오고<br>전체 수강생 수행평가 점수 붙여넣으시면<br>- 입력 불가한 점수를 받은 아이의 명단이 뜹니다.<br>선택과목용은 출석부 붙여넣고 나머지 다 붙여넣으시면<br>- 선택한 아이들은 색이 바뀌고 그 아이들 숫자의 오류사항도 뜹니다.<br><br>오류명단 학급순 배열하려다가<br>바빠서 업글 못 했어요 ㅎㅎㅎㅎ<br><br>한번 써보세요. 저희 성적계 선생님이 너무 좋아하셨어요.<br>자유롭게 복사해서 쓰시면 됩니다.<br><br>전체 수강자용<br><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1NmeaFlIwszNMTgZJSfixFGws0ZOjU-LNCOQXcie2VrE/copy\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1NmeaFlIwszNMTgZJSfixFGws0ZOjU-LNCOQXcie2VrE/copy</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Google Sheets: 로그인\" data-og-description=\"여기를 눌러 링크를 확인하세요\" data-og-host=\"accounts.google.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1NmeaFlIwszNMTgZJSfixFGws0ZOjU-LNCOQXcie2VrE/copy\" data-og-url=\"https://accounts.google.com/v3/signin/identifier?continue=https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.google.com%2Fspreadsheets%2Fd%2F1NmeaFlIwszNMTgZJSfixFGws0ZOjU-LNCOQXcie2VrE%2Fcopy&amp;dsh=S1999368149%3A1782480313037637&amp;followup=https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.google.com%2Fspreadsheets%2Fd%2F1NmeaFlIwszNMTgZJSfixFGws0ZOjU-LNCOQXcie2VrE%2Fcopy&amp;ltmpl=sheets&amp;osid=1&amp;passive=1209600&amp;service=wise&amp;flowName=WebLiteSignIn&amp;flowEntry=ServiceLogin&amp;ifkv=AcDsRvxLk9xLC1DhYs9LrlLf1B-nmWQVUYAupApZaKt9ioa8P_HEn2lhyb3RaXYpoA5T75NqdR5I\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/DYVQ5/dJMb81f2NvX/s4EIN8Z5xNhaKKyg2rZoa1/kakaolink40_original.png?width=148&amp;height=48\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1NmeaFlIwszNMTgZJSfixFGws0ZOjU-LNCOQXcie2VrE/copy\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1NmeaFlIwszNMTgZJSfixFGws0ZOjU-LNCOQXcie2VrE/copy\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/DYVQ5/dJMb81f2NvX/s4EIN8Z5xNhaKKyg2rZoa1